<section aria-labelledby="qr-guide-title" class="qr-seo-section"><div class="qr-shell"><header class="qr-seo-heading"><p class="qr-kicker"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> Free Custom QR Code Generator</p><h2 id="qr-guide-title">Create a QR code people can scan with confidence</h2><p>The builder stays simple at the top. This guide below explains the details when you need them.</p></header><div class="qr-seo-layout"><article><h3>What you can create</h3><ul><li>Website and landing-page QR codes</li><li>WhatsApp chats with an optional message</li><li>Wi-Fi access without typing the password</li><li>Email, phone, SMS, contact and location QR codes</li></ul></article><article><h3>How to get a reliable result</h3><ol><li>Choose the correct QR type.</li><li>Enter complete and accurate details.</li><li>Keep strong contrast between the QR code and background.</li><li>Add a small, clear logo only when needed.</li><li>Test the QR code with a phone before sharing or printing.</li></ol></article></div><div class="qr-seo-faq"><h3>Frequently asked questions</h3><details><summary>Is this QR Code Generator free?</summary><p>Yes. It is free to use, requires no account, and generates the QR code in your browser.</p></details><details><summary>Can I create a QR code with a logo?</summary><p>Yes. Open the Logo step, upload an image, select square, rounded or circular, and adjust the logo size.</p></details><details><summary>Can I add text above and below the QR code?</summary><p>Yes. Open Poster Text to use editable smart suggestions, switch either line on or off, and optionally show athanasinspires.com at the bottom.</p></details><details><summary>Should I download the poster or QR code only?</summary><p>Choose the A4 PDF poster for professional printing, poster PNG for digital sharing, or QR Only for a clean PNG without text and the poster frame.</p></details><details><summary>Why might a QR code fail to scan?</summary><p>Low colour contrast, incomplete details, an oversized logo, a damaged image, or printing it too small can make scanning difficult. Use the Test QR button before sharing.</p></details></div><nav aria-label="Related digital tools" class="qr-related-tools"><a href="index.html">Explore All Digital Tools <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="typing-trainer.html">Typing Speed Trainer <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="scientific-calculator.html">Scientific Calculator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav></div></section></main>
